tform": 48, "y": 2026, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 847351, "date": 1774310400, "platform": 167, "y": 2026, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 742250, "date": 1755734400, "platform": 167, "y": 2025, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}, {"id": 742248, "date": 1755734400, "platform": 130, "y": 2025, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}, {"id": 742249, "date": 1755734400, "platform": 48, "y": 2025, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}, {"id": 887971, "date": 1777420800, "platform": 6, "y": 2026, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1516844, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwiek.jpg"}, {"id": 1516848, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwieo.jpg"}, {"id": 1516849, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwiep.jpg"}, {"id": 1516850, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwieq.jpg"}, {"id": 1516845, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwiel.jpg"}, {"id": 1516847, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwien.jpg"}, {"id": 1516846, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwiem.jpg"}], "slug": "ariana-and-the-elder-codex--1", "storyline": "1,500 years ago, there was a person who brought magic to humanity. That person gifted mankind four magic books called \u201cThe Books of the Four Elements,\u201d which produce magic power, and a \u201cMagic Pen\u201d that creates magic books.\n\nOnce humanity learned of the concepts of \u201cmagic\u201d and \u201cmagic power,\u201d they used the Magic Pen to create various magic books.\n\nAmong those books, three known as \u201cThe Books of the Three Phenomena\u201d were said to possess magic power comparable to the Books of the Four Elements. These seven books are collectively called \u201cThe Books of the Seven Heroes,\u201d and the facility for managing and mending magic books is called the \u201cLibrary.\u201d\n\nPresent day\u2014.\n\nAn incident breaks out in the Library, a vast aggregation of knowledge and the source of all magic power. Someone has tampered with the Books of the Seven Heroes.\n\nAs a result, magic disappeared from the world\u2026", "summary": "The Librarian Ariana\u2019s mission is to repair the Seven Hero Codices, which have been altered. Due to the terrible damages, magic has vanished from the world.\n\nBy utilizing special Librarian magic that allows her to enter Codices, Ariana seeks to mend the books to bring back magic. Can Ariana safely repair each tome and unravel the mysteries hidden within the Library?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/ariana-and-the-elder-codex--1", "videos": [{"id": 150366, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Hb7tEDwt4Fs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hb7tEDwt4Fs", "title": "\u300e#\u9b54\u6cd5\u53f8\u66f8\u30a2\u30ea\u30a2\u30ca \uff5e\u4e03\u82f1\u5091\u306e\u66f8\uff5e\u300f\u30a2\u30ca\u30a6\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Hb7tEDwt4Fs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 165926, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "AllbhGbWjCI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AllbhGbWjCI", "title": "Ariana and the Elder Codex | Announcement Trailer (NA) | PS4\u00ae, PS5\u00ae, and Nintendo Switch\u2122", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AllbhGbWjCI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 181749, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "a9JpNUGqmHc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a9JpNUGqmHc", "title": "Ariana and the Elder Codex | System Trailer | Steam\u00ae, PS4\u00ae, PS5\u00ae, and Nintendo Switch\u2122", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/a9JpNUGqmHc/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}